1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,290
Dexter: Hey, remember when we played Catan with Bobby last Friday?

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:08,200
Milo: Yeah. He took the longest road and then trade-blocked me for forty minutes. Total tyrant.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:12,770
Dexter: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:18,140
Milo: Wha... what? What do you mean, a feeling? Like, indigestion?

5
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:30,900
Dexter: The way he moves the pieces... the way he builds. That long... long road of his.  And the way he whispers, ore for wheat.

6
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:36,680
Milo: I... guess? He does have a really good... settlement placement?

7
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:41,760
Dexter: And when he rolled a seven and moved the robber?  I had to leave the room.

8
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,080
Milo: Dude. We were playing at your house.

9
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:48,880
Dexter: So... you also find him sexy when he plays Catan?
